BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:King Flip (Not Your Average Toy Story)
DTSTART:20260607T000000Z
DTEND:20260607T023500Z
DTSTAMP:20260607T000000Z
UID:TGBvKdo9Tp
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 137 mins (2h17m)\n\nPresented by EASTSIDEOFTHEBRAIN
 .  A country boy moves to Seattle for work but ends up finding a bit more
  than that as he takes an interest from seeing all the graffiti in the cit
 y and tries to give it a go himself. Yet not knowing anyone he takes moder
 n routes to try and learn the culture and has some hard lessons along the 
 way. The film dances around the impact of new age graffiti and the rough a
 nd ugly side it graffiti has to offer.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-t
 heaters/king-flip-(not-your-average-toy-story)\n\nEstimated start: 17:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
